1
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,100
这是您点的今日鱼餐
Here's your fish of the day.

2
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,540
小姐  不好意思
Excuse me, miss?

3
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,360
我的烘肉卷里有根头发
There's a hair in my meatloaf.

4
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,520
这事情绝对是个案
This never happens.

5
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:14,813
奥列格
Oleg!

6
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,081
T-2里有H-34
We got a H-34 at T-2!

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,601
毛发吗  不可能啊
A hair? That's impossible.

8
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,120
我先把裤子穿上
Let me put some pants on.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,720
我深表遗憾
I am so sorry

10
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,280
您居然点了烘肉卷吃
that you ordered the meatloaf.

11
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,840
他不是应该戴个发网吗
Shouldn't he be in a hairnet?

12
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,560
他最应该的是进监狱
He should be in a prison.

13
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,980
好消息
Good news.

14
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,880
这根不是我的
It's not mine.

15
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:41,100
我的生发剂真的很有效啊
That Propecia's really paying off.

16
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,160
这也很明显不是我的  我是金毛丫头
Obviously, it's not mine. I'm blonde.

17
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,920
你也不是全身都"金毛"啊
You're not blonde everywhere.

18
00:00:45,972 --> 00:00:49,210
我就爱听人聊"地毯跟窗帘"
I love carpet-and-drapes talk.

19
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,740
我想要回我的钱
I want my money back.

20
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:51,860
我也想
Me too.

21
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,880
这根也不是我的
Well, it ain't mine.

22
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,020
我还有这么长的头发那会
Last time my hair was this long,

23
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,920
还是我80年代在歌舞节目当舞者的时候呢
I was a back-up dancer on Solid Gold.

24
00:01:00,972 --> 00:01:02,780
阿憨
Han!

25
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,660
我们有个龟毛屁事多的顾客
We got a customer with a hair up his butt

26
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,620
他的后肉卷里也有根毛
and one in his meatloaf.

27
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,020
一边去
Step aside.

28
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,400
待本山人一看究竟
Let an expert through.

29
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:10,920
是电视剧《法律与秩序  特殊受矮者》
Look, it's "Law and Order: SAD"

30
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:16,880
棕色毛发  介于咖啡色与深褐色之间
It's brown, somewhere between coffee and burnt sienna,

31
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:20,520
用洗发沐浴混合露潦草清洗过
cleaned hastily with a combination shampoo-body wash.

32
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:25,360
这根头发的主人是个单身狗白人
Mm, this hair belongs to a single white man

33
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:29,100
是没人爱  而非想单身  而且注定单身到死...
alone, and not by choice, but so set in his ways--

34
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:29,740
够了
Okay!

35
00:01:30,940 --> 00:01:31,980
是我的头发
It's mine!

36
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,720
下次想骗吃骗喝
Next time you want a free meal,

37
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:36,020
记得点今日鱼餐
order the fish of the day.

38
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,000
对吧  女士
Am I right, ma'am?

39
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,360
我能点个东西吗
Hey, can I order something?

40
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,380
你得先出示证件
I'm gonna need to see some ID.

41
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,160
我又想浪迹天涯了
I'm getting the itch to hit the road again

42
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,140
需要个新身份
and I'll need a new identity.

43
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,300
我要一杯莫斯科驴子
I'll have a Moscow Mule.

44
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,440
来一杯综合水果饮料酒吧
Uh, how about a Jolly Rancher shot?

45
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:10,060
这是我们的招牌饮品之一
They're one of our signature drinks,

46
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:12,440
杯中还会以我的指枪点缀呢
served with a side of my finger-guns.

47
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:14,920
来一杯莫斯科驴子如何
How about a Moscow Mule

48
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,740
毕竟我刚才点的就是这个
since that's what I just ordered?

49
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:18,400
你确定吗
Oh, are you sure?

50
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,520
烈酒杯是用真的水果饮料杯来装的呢
The shot glasses are made of actual Jolly Ranchers.

51
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,633
小孩特爱呢
Kids love 'em.

52
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,320
一杯莫斯科驴子马上来
One Moscow Mule coming up.

53
00:02:27,744 --> 00:02:30,390
好咧
All righty.

54
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,020
你不知道怎么调  对吧
You don't know how to make one, do you?

55
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:32,880
完全不会
No clue.

56
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,200
那我自己来调如何
How 'bout I just make it myself?

57
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:38,160
既然你都动手了  给我来杯杰克和可乐
Hmm, while you're at it, I'll have a Jack and Coke.

58
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,180
一直都想知道这酒是用什么调出来的
Always wanted to know what was in that.

59
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,480
麦克斯  那个男的在你身后干嘛
Max, what's that guy doing behind you?

60
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:45,900
你明知道男人在我身后干嘛时我从不回头看
You know I never look when they're back there.

61
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,540
你不能让别人自己给自己服务
Look, you can't let people serve themselves.

62
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:52,500
不是什么哪里都是自助餐店好吗
Again, not everything is a Hometown Buffet.

63
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,500
如果这里是  我已经在吃
Uh, if it were, I'd be eating a biscuit

64
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,100
饼干通心粉加布丁了
with macaroni and pudding on top.

65
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:00,320
顾客都不点我们的招牌酒饮
People aren't ordering our signature drinks.

66
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,300
他们要喝真的酒
They want real ones,

67
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:03,280
但我只会调我们菜单上有的那些
and I only know how to make the stuff on the menu.

68
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,560
还有摇头丸加棒棒糖  我叫它"加棒"
And Molly lollipops, which I call "Mollipops"

69
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,780
那还是我来调吧
Then let me do it.

70
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:11,600
我万圣节后昏睡三天就是因为你的"特调酒"吗
And is that why I slept for three days after Halloween?

71
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,440
我能要灰狗吗
Can I get a greyhound?

72
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:16,760
灰狗...
Greyhound...

73
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,740
我已经不在灰狗巴士开大巴了
I don't drive for them anymore.

74
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:22,680
政策啥的
Politics!

75
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:25,620
喂  有人点单了
Uh, you heard the man.

76
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:28,020
我们付钱给你可不是让你在这白站着
We're not paying you to just stand around.

77
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,740
你们压根就没付我钱
You're not paying me at all.

78
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:32,020
就你这态度还想挣钱
Not with that attitude.

79
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,360
相信我  我们要是够钱请酒保  早就请了
Believe me, if we could afford a bartender, we'd hire one.

80
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:37,480
看来这合作关系是合不来了
This obviously isn't working out for either of us.

81
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,880
给你的服务有啥问题吗  小费呢
Was there a problem with your service?

82
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:49,200
麦克斯  我们得谈谈昨晚发生的事
Max, we need to talk about what happened last night.

83
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,300
靠  你明明说你有在吃事前避孕药
Oh, crap, you said you were on the pill.

84
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,880
我们甜品酒吧需要有个人
We need someone at the dessert bar

85
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,500
懂得怎么调真正的酒饮
who knows how to make real drinks.

86
00:03:56,780 --> 00:04:00,000
绝不是嫌弃你的"烟屁股汤力"销量不好
Not that your "Cigarette butt and toni" wasn't a hit.

87
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:02,860
是你说我们请不起酒保
You said we couldn't afford a bartender...

88
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,260
或是买机械牛
or a mechanical bull,

89
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,040
要是当时买了  现在早赚回本了
which would have paid for itself by now.

90
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,760
我有个主意
Here's my idea.

91
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,980
我们可以去上调酒课  这样...
We are going to bartending school so we can--

92
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,720
别踹我  我们就能成为
and don't kick me-- be the best--

93
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:13,880
别捏我  也别打鼻子
no pinching, not my nose--

94
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,440
一家我们想成为的好店
business we can be!

95
00:04:15,489 --> 00:04:16,630
我弹
G'doink.

96
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,930
你没说不能弹
You didn't say anything about G'doinks.

97
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,900
你觉得如何
What do you think?

98
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:21,800
因为我们已经报名付费  而且不能退钱了
'Cause we're already signed up and it's non-refundable.

99
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,340
我从你的存钱小猪烟斗里拿了你的学费
I took your share out of your piggy bong.

100
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,860
你居然从招财跟进宝里偷钱
You stole from Cheech and Change?

101
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:32,640
你不喜欢我这主意  说就是了
Okay, you can say you hate the idea,

102
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,360
你不需要哇哇哭吧
but you don't have to cry about it.

103
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:37,180
这孩子裤裆里的屎[一派胡言]多到
Man, this baby's more full of crap

104
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:38,760
比酷玩乐队专辑里还多
than a Coldplay album.

105
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:42,980
我现在替你换尿布  但等你长大了
Fine, I'll change your diaper, but when you grow up,

106
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:45,060
记得还我这份情  也替我换
you're going to have to return the favor.

107
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:48,260
尿布包反了
The diaper goes the other way!

108
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,260
厄尔  是那个娃娃说话了
Earl, did that doll just talk

109
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:54,220
还是脑海中的声音又让我开始杀戮了
or are the voices telling me to kill again?

110
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,040
不是  这娃娃吼了我一整天了
No, no, it's been yelling at me all day.

111
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:58,620
除了这个  还有我助听器
Between this and the police chatter

112
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:00,260
接收到的警察无线电
I pick up on my hearing aid,

113
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:03,240
我脑子里就跟开派对似的
it's like a damn party in my head.

114
00:05:05,327 --> 00:05:05,661
收到
Roger that.

115
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,000
这个娃娃还能再更吓人一点吗
Can this doll get any creepier?

116
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,920
卡洛琳  你也好不到哪去
Takes one to know one, Caroline.

117
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,700
你问了  她答了
Asked and answered.

118
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,660
一位淑女就不能抽烟撒尿时
Can't a lady have a smoke and a tinkle

119
00:05:17,660 --> 00:05:19,620
不用操心着自己的孩子吗
without having to worry about her baby?

120
00:05:20,728 --> 00:05:22,061
你刚才从厕所里在偷看我们吗
You were watching us from the toilet?

121
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:25,160
你不能像别人一样捂鼻子从隔间上方偷看吗
Can't you just hold your nose and hover like everyone else?

122
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:28,560
这是我的监控娃娃  你看
It's my surveillance doll. Look.

123
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,860
它连接到我手机里的一个软件了
It's hooked up to an app in my phone.

124
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,760
看  她...
Look, she's got

125
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,860
眼珠里有摄像头
cameras in her eyeballs;

126
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,300
嘴巴有个麦克风
she's got a microphone in her mouth;

127
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:41,380
屁眼还有个激光指示器
and look, a laser pointer in her butt.

128
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:45,000
这是美国女孩娃娃之爱国者法案版吗
Is that the American Girl Doll PATRIOT Act edition?

129
00:05:46,020 --> 00:05:47,640
她是不是超可爱
Isn't she cute?

130
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:50,580
就像是我的双胞胎姐妹
Look, she's like my twin,

131
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,260
差别只在比我更活生生
only more alive.

132
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:58,660
谢谢你替我留心照顾芭芭拉
Thank you for keeping your eye on Barbara.

133
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,700
非常谢谢你
Well, thanks so much.

134
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:05,980
我很乐意付你钱
I'd pay you,

135
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:08,100
但我知道你骄傲的自尊不容许自己收下钱
but I know you're too proud to take the money.

136
00:06:08,780 --> 00:06:10,820
苏菲  其实我的药费单堆积如山...
Uh, actually, the medical bills are piling up, Sophie.

137
00:06:10,939 --> 00:06:13,024
-再见啦  -我其实还挺需要...
-Well, see you later! -And I could really use...

138
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:17,840
如果你需要免费保姆  找他
If you need a free babysitter, that guy.

139
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:20,760
是我的问题
Is it just me

140
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:22,940
还是店里又热又雾蒙蒙
or is it hot and blurry in here?

141
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,900
先生  失礼了
Pardon me, sir.

142
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:28,020
天啊  阿憨
Oh, my God, Han.

143
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:30,840
你浑身起了斑  还有幻觉
You're covered in spots and you're delirious.

144
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,400
你长水痘[鸡痘]啦
You have chicken pox.

145
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:35,040
你也还有小鸡腿  所以你也算齐活儿啦
You also have chicken legs, so I guess you're even.

146
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,040
阿憨  你得回家隔离
Han, you have to go home.

147
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:38,060
你这病有传染性
You're contagious.

148
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,540
而且不是我笑声这种好的传染性
And not like my laugh.

149
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:47,420
欢迎来到餐厅堡威廉斯
Welcome to the Dinersburg Williams.

150
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:49,141
那胡话谁说的
Who said that?

151
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:51,360
是你说的  你必须得回家
You did! You have to go home.

152
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:54,430
我的确不介意回家躺床上
Well, I suppose I could get into bed

153
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,560
在线看点《明迪烦事多》
and Hulu a little Mindy Project.

154
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,541
哎妈  她可真"人生计划"啊
And, boy, is she a project.

155
00:07:03,874 --> 00:07:04,980
阿憨看起来不太稳定
Han looked pretty unsteady.

156
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:07,160
你觉得该找人确保他安全回家吗
Do you think someone should make sure he gets home okay?

157
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,300
别杞人忧天  他没事的
Don't worry so much. He'll be fine.

158
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:17,801
你看  没事
See? Fine.

159
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:23,466
我知道这只是调酒课
I know this is just bartending class,

160
00:07:23,587 --> 00:07:24,740
但麻烦吐出口香糖
but gum, please?

161
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:28,120
告诉你  这其实是嚼用烟草
That was chewing tobacco, FYI.

162
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,960
麦克斯  我们得认真上课
We need to take this seriously, Max.

163
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,140
那是小折刀吗
Is that a pocket knife?

164
00:07:35,346 --> 00:07:35,661
是啊
Uh, yeah.

165
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:37,811
我要是不在桌子上刻名字缩写
How are they gonna know I was here

166
00:07:37,821 --> 00:07:39,540
他们怎么知道我在这上课
if I can't carve my initials in the desk?

167
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:42,740
或许我们俩不应该坐在同一个工作台
Maybe we should sit at separate workstations.

168
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:44,860
我很明显会是班级尖子生
I'm obviously gonna be the top student here

169
00:07:44,870 --> 00:07:46,365
我不想跟你那
and I don't want to be associated with your

170
00:07:46,731 --> 00:07:48,740
"又叛逆又没医保"的姿态扯上关系
"rebel without health insurance" attitude.

171
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,181
随便你  拜拜
Fine, smell you later.

172
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:54,184
你好
Hi.

173
00:07:54,204 --> 00:07:55,823
我毕业后就没上过课
I haven't been in a class

174
00:07:55,884 --> 00:07:57,300
我是从沃顿商学院毕业的
since I graduated from Wharton.

